      "weather": "Fine",
      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NANGAR FINN (7) is a first starter from the A Barnes yard by Bernardo out of Nangar Lucy. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Has a nice profile and expected to measure up at first outing. RED ROCK OLLIE (5) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (23.32) at this track behind Tralee Maverick in a Maiden. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Expected to be in the finish again. SWIFT ARIEL (8) has an excellent record over this journey having never missed the placings in three starts, including two wins. Hit the frame latest (23.64) when second at this track in a Grade 5. Can hit the frame with the right run. EAR MUFFS (1) was in the money last start and likely to feature again.",
